 {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory2_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "901028398300270", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974869_901028401633603_627257832616781480_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NwaFD5gCSd8Q7kNvwGwtOQX&_nc_oc=Adkoc4JZ8nuZoeI__LZGhS9N3DifVetU0yX92Y_N7TFIE5WqG7b0QlKDZs9G2jboW8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwYTs0vHi4tBQY77Tc-BLUONie_z3HZTulrL4pbYnP4JQ&oe=69B41C9F"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory1_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "985952625960516", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254875_985952629293849_7550419092568334009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JqrCStZHDk4Q7kNvwGsxv2_&_nc_oc=AdkQ4yl5u9zWjRJDgAxHA2InnH9x1ztJZpat46ALmWhrqwIRg81G189Z5OONecbnFxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxHcjWpGsit7pnDnZLwUB48qrIhSiYnVMJNkuwYXZFKGQ&oe=69B410A0"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory_Wide_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "3552569408344767", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031495_3552569411678100_5955106357745012263_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8zTFf_owvcQ7kNvwHJdnZh&_nc_oc=AdlgExrvJRNbacMTY6IxIOCyHDO2uYHFnO2XHn2Yw3dtBvy589oHDFMtK9tlxm2zsis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwG9NT8yd8qucyr_6pSPl6FmYihuR2gd4z47gQ93EizMA&oe=69B401F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-art_landscape.png", "id": "862962371915225", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982538_862962375248558_5129333378553841424_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SW4vzOrrzCUQ7kNvwGCyvcx&_nc_oc=Adn4alW-KPhCJZqc9eKpdOraG7AmXj1L_v8s4xBPEkx98NkM2ilJCg9LLs8_XJFL1Tg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxfpXZ_Xwx6cqjDwNHKRC3q41vn8bC4DODfzNAgQoSONw&oe=69B3F34A"}, "display_name": "Sensory Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Imagine if you could be instantly transported to a magical, calming world. \n\n\ud83c\udfb6 \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f A place where you could let go of everyday stresses and be soothed by relaxing visuals, tactile sensations and gentle sounds.\n\nNOW YOU CAN!\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Inspired by the many hundreds of real-life Sensory Rooms in the world, Your VR Therapy now makes it possible to experience these important relaxation facilities virtually.\n\nAnd for a tiny fraction of the cost.\n\n**WHAT ARE SENSORY ROOMS?**\nThese are widely used to help people with stress issues and learning difficulties. They offer a safe space to unwind and engage in gently stimulating activities.\n\n**OUR VIRTUAL SENSORY ROOM **\nFrom the comfort of your home, you can now enter a realm of relaxation and sensory exploration \u2013 instantly. \n\nCreated in collaboration with trained Sensory Room experts, our space offers:\n\n\u2013 CALMING VISUALS -- \n\n\u2013 SOOTHING SOUNDS \u2013\n\n\u2013 INTERACTIVE OBJECTS \u2013\n\nWhich all help to promote comfort and self-discovery.\n\nThis virtual oasis has been developed for both adults and their family members in need of some safe, relaxing 'me' time.\n\nIt offers a rare opportunity to step away from the stresses of everyday life.\n\nOur highly interactive app:\n- Enables you to let off steam in a secure, controlled environment.\n- Promotes individual play and discovery.\n- Is designed by experts to enhance emotional development.\n- Requires no travel to a physical location.\n\nSTART YOUR RELAXATION TODAY!", "short_description": "Your VR Therapy's virtual Sensory Room is a highly interactive and engaging alternative to expensive real-world Sensory Rooms, which are widely used in both clinical and educational settings.\n\nOur expertly-designed VR space allows you to enter a calming virtual room and embark on a journey of relaxation in your own home.\n\nDownload today and discover this revolutionary new way of enjoying the Sensory Room experience with zero fuss, travel or ongoing expense."}]}